---

<section id="kontak" class="py-20 sm:py-24 bg-white border-b border-slate-200/80">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 lg:gap-14 items-center">
      
      <!-- Left Column: Field Engineer Showcase (MSC Scaffolding Pattern) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 flex justify-center">
        <div class="relative w-full max-w-sm aspect-[4/5] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-md bg-slate-950">
          <img
            src="/images/engineer-team.webp"
            alt="Tim Engineering dan Pelaksana Pondasi Mandiri"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover object-top filter brightness-[0.98]"
            loading="lazy"
          />
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-950/80 via-transparent to-transparent"></div>
          
          <div class="absolute bottom-4 left-4 right-4 bg-white/95 backdrop-blur-[6px] px-5 py-3.5 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-100">
            <div class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-950">Tim Engineering Lapangan</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-orange-700 font-semibold">Spesialis Geoteknik & Pondasi Dalam</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Consultation Proposition -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-950 tracking-normal leading-tight">
            Konsultasi Pondasi & Estimasi Proyek
          </h2>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base mt-2 leading-relaxed">
            Konsultasi teknis langsung untuk menghitung jumlah titik tiang bor, kapasitas beban dukung tanah, dan efisiensi anggaran konstruksi proyek Anda.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-3 pt-1 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-orange-50 border border-orange-200 flex items-center justify-center text-orange-700 shrink-0">
              <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <span>Evaluasi data sondir (SPT) & analisis daya dukung tanah gratis</span>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-orange-50 border border-orange-200 flex items-center justify-center text-orange-700 shrink-0">
              <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <span>Rekomendasi metode paling efisien (Wash Boring / Dry Auger / Rig)</span>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-orange-50 border border-orange-200 flex items-center justify-center text-orange-700 shrink-0">
              <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <span>Jadwal survei fisik ke lokasi proyek di berbagai wilayah operasional Indonesia</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-4 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 items-start sm:items-center">
          <a
            id="btn_consultation_wa"
            href="https://wa.me/6285183005070?text=Halo%20Pondasi%20Mandiri,%20saya%20ingin%20konsultasi%20kebutuhan%20bor%20pile%20untuk%20proyek%20saya"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-8 py-3.5 rounded-lg bg-orange-700 hover:bg-orange-600 active:scale-95 text-white font-semibold text-xs sm:text-sm tracking-wide shadow-md transition-colors"
          >
            <span>Hubungi WhatsApp Tim Estimator (0851-8300-5070)</span>
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3" />
            </svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
